ng-card","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Postdoctoral researchers"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Candidates should hold, or be close to completing, a Ph.D. in applied mathematics. Candidates' research interests should align with mathematical finance, uncertainty quantification, or machine learning."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Application materials"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Curriculum vitae"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"A research statement"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Representative papers or preprints"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"List of publications"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"application-panel","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"opening-kicker","children":"How to apply"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Send your materials by email"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["Please email ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:caozhongyuan@cuhk.edu.cn","children":"caozhongyuan@cuhk.edu.cn"}]," ","with the subject line ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"“Ph.D. Application – Your Name”"}]," or"," ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"“Postdoctoral Application – Your Name.”"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Information about graduate study is available from the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://sse-mphil-phd.cuhk.edu.cn/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"School of Science and Engineering"}]," ","at"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.cuhk.edu.cn/en","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"CUHK-Shenzhen"}],"."]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"content-section chinese-opening","lang":"zh-Hans","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"博士生与博士后招聘"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"欢迎对金融数学、随机分析、随机控制、平均场博弈与控制，以及复杂异质系统在金融和人工智能中的应用感兴趣的博士生和博士后申请加入课题组。"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["请将个人简历、成绩单（博士申请）、研究兴趣或研究计划，以及相关论文或其他材料发送至",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:caozhongyuan@cuhk.edu.cn","children":" caozhongyuan@cuhk.edu.cn"}],"。 邮件标题请注明“博士申请—姓名”或“博士